no yo u de</span></p><p begin="9.412" end="11.836" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">猛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="9.412" end="9.637">たけ</span></span></span><span begin="9.820" end="10.068">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">火</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.068" end="10.252">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="10.252" end="10.500">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">宿</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.500" end="10.684">やど</span></span></span><span begin="11.012" end="11.164">し</span><span begin="11.164" end="11.380">て</span><span begin="11.381" end="11.597">い</span><span begin="11.597" end="11.836">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我心中已经燃起了火焰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ta ke ru hi wo ya do shi te i ta</span></p><p begin="13.092" end="15.625" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">昨日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="13.092" end="13.819">きのう</span></span></span><span begin="13.819" end="14.016">ま</span><span begin="14.016" end="14.427">で</span><span begin="14.427" end="14.619">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.619" end="15.234">ぼく</span></span></span><span begin="15.234" end="15.625">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为改写昨天为止的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki no u ma de no bo ku no</span></p><p begin="15.868" end="18.702" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歴</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="15.868" end="16.424">れき</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">史</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="16.424" end="16.640">し</span></span></span><span begin="16.640" end="16.847">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">塗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="16.847" end="17.060">ぬ</span></span></span><span begin="17.060" end="17.267">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">替</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="17.267" end="17.281">か</span></span></span><span begin="17.281" end="17.365">え</span><span begin="17.365" end="17.627">る</span><span begin="17.627" end="17.874">た</span><span begin="17.874" end="18.090">め</span><span begin="18.090" end="18.702">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自己的历史</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">re ki shi wo nu ri ka e ru ta me no</span></p><p begin="19.653" end="25.051" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">始</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="19.653" end="19.837">はじ</span></span></span><span begin="20.213" end="20.589">め</span><span begin="20.589" end="20.857">よ</span><span begin="20.857" end="21.125">う</span><span begin="21.125" end="21.816">か</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.063" end="22.463">せい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">紀</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.463" end="22.704">き</span></span></span><span begin="22.704" end="22.895">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">揺</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.895" end="23.184">ゆ</span></span></span><span begin="23.184" end="23.533">る</span><span begin="23.533" end="23.792">が</span><span begin="23.792" end="23.975">す</span><span begin="23.975" end="24.147">よ</span><span begin="24.147" end="24.319">う</span><span begin="24.320" end="25.051">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此启动它吧 那似能动摇世纪的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ha ji me yo u ka se i ki wo yu ru ga su yo u na</span></p><p begin="25.330" end="32.485" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">衝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="25.330" end="25.786">しょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">撃</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="25.786" end="25.993">げき</span></span></span><span begin="26.162" end="26.297">の</span><span begin="26.297" end="26.682">プ</span><span begin="26.682" end="27.066">ロ</span><span begin="27.066" end="27.322">ロ</span><span begin="27.323" end="27.579">ー</span><span begin="27.579" end="27.755">グ</span><span begin="27.755" end="32.485">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">震撼序章</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sho u ge ki no pu ro ro o gu wo</span></p><p begin="31.991" end="35.702" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.991" end="32.246">こ</span><span begin="32.246" end="32.465">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">胸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="32.465" end="33.024">むね</span></span></span><span begin="33.024" end="33.269">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">脈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="33.269" end="33.691">みゃく</span></span></span><span begin="33.691" end="33.788">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">打</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="33.788" end="34.021">う</span></span></span><span begin="34.021" end="34.225">つ</span><span begin="34.225" end="34.487">の</span><span begin="34.487" end="34.687">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">急</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="34.687" end="34.863">せ</span></span></span><span begin="34.863" end="35.228">か</span><span begin="35.228" end="35.247">す</span><span begin="35.247" end="35.506">ほ</span><span begin="35.506" end="35.702">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去探寻一处能让此心急促跳动的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ko no mu ne ga mya ku wo u tsu no wo se ka su ho do</span></p><p begin="35.702" end="39.274" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.702" end="35.836">み</span></span></span><span begin="35.836" end="36.245">た</span><span begin="36.245" end="36.468">こ</span><span begin="36.468" end="36.660">と</span><span begin="36.660" end="36.900">も</span><span begin="36.900" end="37.052">な</span><span begin="37.052" end="37.252">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">景</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.252" end="37.506">け</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.506" end="38.294">しき</span></span></span><span begin="38.294" end="38.725">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">探</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="38.725" end="39.155">さが</span></span></span><span begin="39.155" end="39.199">そ</span><span begin="39.199" end="39.274">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从未领略的风景吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mi ta ko to mo na i ke shi ki wo sa ga so u</span></p><p begin="39.498" end="44.805" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.498" end="39.939">みち</span></span></span><span begin="39.939" end="40.074">な</span><span begin="40.074" end="40.306">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="40.306" end="40.763">みち</span></span></span><span begin="40.763" end="41.066">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">光</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.066" end="41.999">ひか</span></span></span><span begin="41.999" end="42.115">り</span><span begin="42.115" end="42.315">だ</span><span begin="42.315" end="42.602">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="42.778" end="43.172">ぼく</span></span></span><span begin="43.172" end="43.458">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">導</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="43.458" end="44.020">みちび</span></span></span><span begin="44.020" end="44.302">く</span><span begin="44.302" end="44.546">ん</span><span begin="44.546" end="44.805">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前人未经之路此刻正闪着微光 指引我向前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mi chi na ki mi chi ga hi ka ri da shi bo ku wo mi chi bi ku n da</span></p><p begin="45.033" end="48.817" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="45.033" end="45.668">こころ</span></span></span><span begin="45.668" end="45.907">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">奥</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="45.907" end="46.070">おく</span></span></span><span begin="46.070" end="46.326">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">動</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="46.326" end="46.679">うご</span></span></span><span begin="46.679" end="46.901">き</span><span begin="46.901" end="47.130">だ</span><span begin="47.130" end="47.178">す</span><span begin="47.178" end="47.421">こ</span><span begin="47.421" end="47.769">と</span><span begin="47.769" end="47.917">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">拒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="47.917" end="48.304">こば</span></span></span><span begin="48.304" end="48.473">ん</span><span begin="48.473" end="48.633">で</span><span begin="48.633" end="48.817">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算心底抗拒着动身</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ko ko ro no o ku ga u go ki da su ko to wo ko ba n de mo</span></p><p begin="48.817" end="52.315" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.817" end="49.340">よる</span></span></span><span begin="49.340" end="49.490">が</span><span begin="49.490" end="49.690">こ</span><span begin="49.690" end="49.930">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="49.930" end="50.145">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="50.145" end="50.500">かい</span></span></span><span begin="50.500" end="50.985">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">包</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="50.985" end="51.565">つつ</span></span></span><span begin="51.565" end="51.648">ん</span><span begin="51.648" end="51.859">で</span><span begin="51.859" end="52.315">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算黑夜将世界包裹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yo ru ga ko no se ka i wo tsu tsu n de mo</span></p><p begin="52.651" end="54.128" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="52.651" end="52.960">む</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">駄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="52.960" end="53.558">だ</span></span></span><span begin="53.558" end="53.768">だ</span><span begin="53.768" end="54.128">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那也无所谓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mu da da yo</span></p><p begin="54.347" end="1:02.172" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.347" end="54.592">こ</span><span begin="54.592" end="55.202">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">火</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="55.202" end="55.420">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="55.420" end="55.977">に</span><span begin="55.977" end="56.245">は</span><span begin="56.245" end="56.307">も</span><span begin="56.307" end="56.646">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="56.792" end="57.818">あらが</span></span></span><span begin="57.818" end="58.003">え</span><span begin="58.003" end="58.403">な</span><span begin="58.403" end="58.583">い</span><span begin="58.583" end="58.763">ん</span><span begin="58.763" end="1:02.172">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我已无法抗拒这团火焰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ko no hi ni ha mo u a ra ga e na i n da</span></p><p begin="1:11.603" end="1:14.108" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.603" end="1:11.603">“</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.603" end="1:11.948">いま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">更</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.948" end="1:12.357">さら</span></span></span><span begin="1:12.357" end="1:12.357">”</span><span begin="1:12.357" end="1:12.631">な</span><span begin="1:12.631" end="1:12.742">ん</span><span begin="1:12.742" end="1:13.001">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.001" end="1:13.209">ぶ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">粋</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.209" end="1:13.660">すい</span></span></span><span begin="1:13.660" end="1:14.108">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“事到如今”什么的何其扫兴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">“ i ma sa ra ” na n te bu su i de</span></p><p begin="1:14.460" end="1:16.681" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.460" end="1:14.598">た</span><span begin="1:14.598" end="1:14.862">だ</span><span begin="1:14.862" end="1:14.862">“</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.862" end="1:15.188">いま</span></span></span><span begin="1:15.188" end="1:15.452">か</span><span begin="1:15.452" end="1:15.701">ら</span><span begin="1:15.701" end="1:15.701">”</span><span begin="1:15.701" end="1:16.078">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:16.078" end="1:16.279">み</span></span></span><span begin="1:16.279" end="1:16.477">て</span><span begin="1:16.477" end="1:16.681">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我的眼中唯有“从今往后”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ta da “ i ma ka ra ” wo mi te ta</span></p><p begin="1:18.060" end="1:20.557" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">明日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:18.060" end="1:18.646">あした</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">以</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:18.646" end="1:18.885">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">降</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:18.885" end="1:19.238">こう</span></span></span><span begin="1:19.238" end="1:19.540">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:19.540" end="1:20.105">ぼく</span></span></span><span begin="1:20.105" end="1:20.557">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为谱写明天之后的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a shi ta i ko u no bo ku no</span></p><p begin="1:20.802" end="1:23.686" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歴</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:20.802" end="1:21.348">れき</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">史</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:21.348" end="1:21.474">し</span></span></span><span begin="1:21.474" end="1:21.674">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">織</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:21.674" end="1:21.914">お</span></span></span><span begin="1:21.914" end="1:22.210">り</span><span begin="1:22.210" end="1:22.386">な</span><span begin="1:22.386" end="1:22.642">す</span><span begin="1:22.642" end="1:22.818">た</span><span begin="1:22.818" end="1:22.970">め</span><span begin="1:22.970" end="1:23.686">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自己的历史</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">re ki shi wo o ri na su ta me no</span></p><p begin="1:24.379" end="1:29.808" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">連</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:24.379" end="1:24.683">つ</span></span></span><span begin="1:24.683" end="1:25.115">れ</span><span begin="1:25.115" end="1:25.410">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">行</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.410" end="1:25.587">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:25.587" end="1:26.050">け</span><span begin="1:26.050" end="1:26.747">よ</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">果</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:26.962" end="1:27.213">は</span></span></span><span begin="1:27.213" end="1:27.400">て</span><span begin="1:27.400" end="1:27.615">ま</span><span begin="1:27.615" end="1:27.816">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:27.816" end="1:28.031">み</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">届</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:28.031" end="1:28.867">とど</span></span></span><span begin="1:28.867" end="1:29.167">け</span><span begin="1:29.167" end="1:29.257">る</span><span begin="1:29.257" end="1:29.808">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我走吧 我会见证至旅途的尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tsu re te i ke yo ha te ma de mi to do ke ru yo</span></p><p begin="1:30.203" end="1:37.790" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">衝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.203" end="1:30.619">しょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">動</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.619" end="1:31.092">どう</span></span></span><span begin="1:31.092" end="1:31.299">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">行</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.299" end="1:31.682">ゆ</span></span></span><span begin="1:31.682" end="1:32.098">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">先</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:32.098" end="1:32.586">さき</span></span></span><span begin="1:32.586" end="1:37.790">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那悸动所示的前方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sho u do u no yu ku sa ki wo</span></p><p begin="1:36.933" end="1:40.593" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.933" end="1:37.166">そ</span><span begin="1:37.166" end="1:37.357">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.357" end="1:37.629">うた</span></span></span><span begin="1:37.932" end="1:38.173">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:38.173" end="1:38.572">ぼく</span></span></span><span begin="1:38.572" end="1:38.767">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">名</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:38.767" end="1:38.988">な</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">前</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:38.988" end="1:39.376">まえ</span></span></span><span begin="1:39.376" end="1:39.591">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">呼</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:39.591" end="1:39.920">よ</span></span></span><span begin="1:39.920" end="1:39.944">ん</span><span begin="1:39.944" end="1:40.201">だ</span><span begin="1:40.201" end="1:40.381">か</span><span begin="1:40.381" end="1:40.593">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因名字被那首歌唤起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so no u ta ga bo ku no na ma e wo yo n da ka ra</span></p><p begin="1:40.593" end="1:44.329" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:40.593" end="1:41.209">いま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.209" end="1:41.400">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.400" end="1:41.854">かい</span></span></span><span begin="1:41.854" end="1:41.993">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">背</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.993" end="1:42.210">せ</span></span></span><span begin="1:42.210" end="1:42.449">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">駆</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.449" end="1:42.833">か</span></span></span><span begin="1:42.833" end="1:43.153">け</span><span begin="1:43.153" end="1:43.520">て</span><span begin="1:43.520" end="1:43.776">し</span><span begin="1:43.776" end="1:43.961">ま</span><span begin="1:43.961" end="1:44.145">お</span><span begin="1:44.145" end="1:44.329">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我便能将世界抛诸身后 向前奔去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i ma se ka i wo se ni ka ke te shi ma o u</span></p><p begin="1:44.329" end="1:47.387" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.329" end="1:44.642">ひ</span><span begin="1:44.642" end="1:44.840">と</span><span begin="1:44.840" end="1:45.048">り</span><span begin="1:45.048" end="1:45.242">よ</span><span begin="1:45.242" end="1:45.446">が</span><span begin="1:45.446" end="1:45.665">り</span><span begin="1:45.665" end="1:45.858">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">光</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:46.074" end="1:47.068">ひかり</span></span></span><span begin="1:47.068" end="1:47.272">で</span><span begin="1:47.272" end="1:47.387">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算是那一厢情愿的光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hi to ri yo ga ri no hi ka ri de mo</span></p><p begin="1:47.570" end="1:49.618" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:47.570" end="1:48.002">ぼく</span></span></span><span begin="1:48.002" end="1:48.274">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">照</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.274" end="1:48.490">て</span></span></span><span begin="1:48.490" end="1:48.698">ら</span><span begin="1:48.698" end="1:48.906">し</span><span begin="1:48.906" end="1:49.114">た</span><span begin="1:49.114" end="1:49.322">ん</span><span begin="1:49.322" end="1:49.618">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也能把我照亮</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">bo ku wo te ra shi ta n da</span></p><p begin="1:49.818" end="1:53.659" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.818" end="1:49.818">「</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">孤</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:49.818" end="1:50.120">こ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">独</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:50.120" end="1:50.535">どく</span></span></span><span begin="1:50.535" end="1:50.670">な</span><span begin="1:50.670" end="1:50.802">ん</span><span begin="1:50.803" end="1:51.026">だ</span><span begin="1:51.026" end="1:51.026">」</span><span begin="1:51.026" end="1:51.282">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">誰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.282" end="1:51.674">だれ</span></span></span><span begin="1:51.674" end="1:51.859">か</span><span begin="1:51.859" end="1:52.090">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">肩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:52.090" end="1:52.514">かた</span></span></span><span begin="1:52.514" end="1:52.739">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">叩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:52.739" end="1:53.182">たた</span></span></span><span begin="1:53.182" end="1:53.346">い</span><span begin="1:53.346" end="1:53.498">て</span><span begin="1:53.498" end="1:53.659">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算有人拍着我的肩说着“很孤独啊”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">「 ko do ku na n da 」 to da re ka ga ka ta wo ta ta i te mo</span></p><p begin="1:53.659" end="1:57.179" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">引</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.659" end="1:53.835">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="1:53.835" end="1:54.107">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">返</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:54.107" end="1:54.475">かえ</span></span></span><span begin="1:54.475" end="1:54.699">す</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">理</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:54.699" end="1:54.923">り</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">由</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:54.923" end="1:55.275">ゆう</span></span></span><span begin="1:55.275" end="1:55.723">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:55.723" end="1:56.059">て</span></span></span><span begin="1:56.059" end="1:56.507">に</span><span begin="1:56.507" end="1:56.581">し</span><span begin="1:56.581" end="1:56.813">て</span><span begin="1:56.813" end="1:57.179">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算找到了回身折返的理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hi ki ka e su ri yu u wo te ni shi te mo</span></p><p begin="1:57.530" end="1:58.907" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:57.530" end="1:57.819">む</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">駄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:57.819" end="1:58.401">だ</span></span></span><span begin="1:58.401" end="1:58.630">だ</span><span begin="1:58.630" end="1:58.907">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那也无所谓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mu da da yo</span></p><p begin="1:59.195" end="2:04.271" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.195" end="1:59.463">こ</span><span begin="1:59.463" end="2:00.019">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">火</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:00.019" end="2:00.243">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="2:00.243" end="2:00.862">に</span><span begin="2:00.862" end="2:01.057">は</span><span begin="2:01.057" end="2:01.278">も</span><span begin="2:01.278" end="2:01.344">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:01.584" end="2:02.488">あらが</span></span></span><span begin="2:02.488" end="2:02.668">わ</span><span begin="2:02.668" end="2:02.851">な</span><span begin="2:02.851" end="2:03.095">い</span><span begin="2:03.095" end="2:03.671">か</span><span begin="2:03.671" end="2:04.271">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我已无法抗拒这团火焰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ko no hi ni ha mo u a ra ga wa na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="2:10.209" end="2:12.586" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.209" end="2:10.530">なん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">度</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.530" end="2:10.729">ど</span></span></span><span begin="2:10.729" end="2:10.973">だ</span><span begin="2:10.973" end="2:11.217">っ</span><span begin="2:11.217" end="2:11.506">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">感</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:11.506" end="2:11.930">かん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">動</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:11.930" end="2:12.362">どう</span></span></span><span begin="2:12.362" end="2:12.586">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那悸动一次又一次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na n do da &apos;t te ka n do u ga</span></p><p begin="2:12.770" end="2:15.902" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.770" end="2:12.970">ぼく</span></span></span><span begin="2:13.122" end="2:13.401">ら</span><span begin="2:13.401" end="2:13.499">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:13.714" end="2:13.907">ひ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">々</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:13.907" end="2:14.403">び</span></span></span><span begin="2:14.403" end="2:14.640">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">灯</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:14.640" end="2:15.163">とも</span></span></span><span begin="2:15.163" end="2:15.221">し</span><span begin="2:15.221" end="2:15.349">た</span><span begin="2:15.349" end="2:15.603">ん</span><span begin="2:15.603" end="2:15.902">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将我们的每一天点亮</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">bo ku ra no hi bi wo to mo shi ta n da</span></p><p begin="2:15.951" end="2:19.039" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.951" end="2:16.432">みち</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">端</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.432" end="2:16.941">ばた</span></span></span><span begin="2:17.059" end="2:17.235">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">石</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.235" end="2:17.720">いし</span></span></span><span begin="2:17.720" end="2:17.870">が</span><span begin="2:17.870" end="2:18.135">い</span><span begin="2:18.135" end="2:18.455">つ</span><span begin="2:18.455" end="2:18.799">か</span><span begin="2:18.799" end="2:19.039">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">路边的石子不知从何时起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mi chi ba ta no i shi ga i tsu ka ra</span></p><p begin="2:19.232" end="2:22.249" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">宝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.232" end="2:19.663">ほう</span></span></span><span tt