;t te ka n do u ga</span></p><p begin="2:25.735" end="2:28.746" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:25.735" end="2:25.927">ぼく</span></span></span><span begin="2:26.079" end="2:26.271">ら</span><span begin="2:26.271" end="2:26.504">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">火</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:26.727" end="2:26.944">ひ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">々</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:26.944" end="2:27.428">び</span></span></span><span begin="2:27.428" end="2:27.653">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">灯</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.653" end="2:28.050">とも</span></span></span><span begin="2:28.050" end="2:28.163">し</span><span begin="2:28.163" end="2:28.342">た</span><span begin="2:28.343" end="2:28.522">ん</span><span begin="2:28.522" end="2:28.746">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将我们的火焰点亮</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">bo ku ra no hi bi wo to mo shi ta n da</span></p><p begin="2:28.970" end="2:31.969" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">消</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:28.970" end="2:29.162">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:29.162" end="2:29.330">え</span><span begin="2:29.330" end="2:29.594">か</span><span begin="2:29.594" end="2:29.782">か</span><span begin="2:29.782" end="2:29.905">っ</span><span begin="2:29.905" end="2:30.065">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">意</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.065" end="2:30.210">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">志</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.210" end="2:30.617">し</span></span></span><span begin="2:30.617" end="2:30.809">が</span><span begin="2:30.809" end="2:30.977">い</span><span begin="2:30.977" end="2:31.337">つ</span><span begin="2:31.337" end="2:31.721">か</span><span begin="2:31.721" end="2:31.969">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">行将溃散的意志不知何时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki e ka ka &apos;t ta i shi ga i tsu ka ra</span></p><p begin="2:32.217" end="2:35.171" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.217" end="2:32.417">こ</span><span begin="2:32.417" end="2:32.617">ん</span><span begin="2:32.617" end="2:32.873">な</span><span begin="2:32.873" end="2:33.109">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">熱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:33.271" end="2:33.886">ねつ</span></span></span><span begin="2:33.886" end="2:34.121">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">纏</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.121" end="2:34.689">まと</span></span></span><span begin="2:34.689" end="2:34.689">っ</span><span begin="2:34.689" end="2:35.171">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竟又被如此热情裹缠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ko n na ni ne tsu wo ma to &apos;t ta</span></p><p begin="2:35.171" end="2:38.886" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.171" end="2:35.427">こ</span><span begin="2:35.427" end="2:35.619">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">胸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:35.619" end="2:35.851">むね</span></span></span><span begin="2:36.251" end="2:36.475">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">脈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.475" end="2:36.951">みゃく</span></span></span><span begin="2:36.951" end="2:37.155">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">打</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:37.155" end="2:37.339">う</span></span></span><span begin="2:37.339" end="2:37.491">つ</span><span begin="2:37.491" end="2:37.699">の</span><span begin="2:37.699" end="2:37.951">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">急</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:37.951" end="2:38.183">せ</span></span></span><span begin="2:38.183" end="2:38.434">か</span><span begin="2:38.434" end="2:38.562">す</span><span begin="2:38.562" end="2:38.714">ほ</span><span begin="2:38.714" end="2:38.886">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去探寻一处能让此心急促跳动的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ko no mu ne ga mya ku wo u tsu no wo se ka su ho do</span></p><p begin="2:38.886" end="2:42.682" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.886" end="2:39.202">み</span></span></span><span begin="2:39.202" end="2:39.616">た</span><span begin="2:39.616" end="2:39.803">こ</span><span begin="2:39.803" end="2:39.983">と</span><span begin="2:39.983" end="2:40.171">も</span><span begin="2:40.171" end="2:40.368">な</span><span begin="2:40.368" end="2:40.593">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">景</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:40.593" end="2:40.806">け</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:40.806" end="2:41.625">しき</span></span></span><span begin="2:41.625" end="2:42.016">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">探</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:42.016" end="2:42.414">さが</span></span></span><span begin="2:42.414" end="2:42.480">そ</span><span begin="2:42.480" end="2:42.681">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从未领略的风景吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mi ta ko to mo na i ke shi ki wo sa ga so u</span></p><p begin="2:42.767" end="2:48.181" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="contai